{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2022",
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "Bundler",
    "lib": ["ES2022", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable"],
    "strict": false,
    "noImplicitAny": false,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "allowSyntheticDefaultImports": true,
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "jsx": "preserve",
    "allowJs": true,
    "checkJs": false,
    "baseUrl": ".",
    "paths": {
      "@/*": ["src/*"]
    },
    "types": ["vitest/globals", "node"]
  },
  "include": [
    "src/**/*.ts",
    "src/**/*.tsx",
    "src/**/*.js",
    "src/**/*.vue",
    "tests/**/*.ts"
  ],
  "exclude": ["node_modules", "dist"]
}
/*
用途：TypeScript 配置（base）
说明：strict 关闭以便渐进迁移；allowJs 让 .js 也能参与 IDE 提示；include 覆盖 src 与 tests。
边界：仅 IDE 提示与 vue-tsc 静态校验；vite 仍按 esbuild 转译。
*/